msgstr "次版本號"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:253
msgid "Architecture-specific flags"
msgstr "架構特定旗標"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:255
msgid ""
"If bit #6 of the header's feature flags byte is set, then a vuint containing"
" optional architecture-specific information will follow the header. The "
"contents of this integer depends on which native architecture the file is "
"meant for."
msgstr "若設定了標頭功能旗標位元組的第 6 位元，則標頭後會接一個包含選用架構特定資訊的 vuint。此整數的內容取決於該檔案所針對的原生架構。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:259
msgid ""
"This is currently used to store which RISC-V processor extensions the MPY "
"file needs to operate correctly besides I, M, C, and Zicsr.  Different "
"flavours of ArmV7 are identified by their native architecture number, but "
"reusing that mechanism would complicate things for RV32 and RV64."
msgstr ""
"這目前用於儲存 MPY 檔案除了 I、M、C 與 Zicsr 之外，還需要哪些 RISC-V 處理器擴充功能才能正確運作。不同版本的 ArmV7 "
"是以其原生架構編號來識別，但若重用該機制則會使 RV32 與 RV64 的處理變得複雜。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:264
msgid ""
"MPY files targeting RV32 or RV64 that do not need any particular processor "
"extensions do not need to provide a flags integer (along with setting the "
"appropriate bit in the header).  The lack of a flags value for RV32 and RV64"
" MPY files is used to indicate that no specific extensions are needed, and "
"saves one byte in the final output binary."
msgstr ""
"針對 RV32 或 RV64 且不需要任何特定處理器擴充功能的 MPY 檔案，不需要提供旗標整數（同時也需在標頭中設定適當的位元）。RV32 與 "
"RV64 MPY 檔案缺少旗標值，即用來表示不需要任何特定擴充功能，並可在最終輸出的二進位檔中節省一個位元組。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:270
msgid ""
"See also the ``-march-flags`` command-line option in both ``mpy-tool.py`` "
"and ``mpy-cross``, and the ``--arch-flags`` command-line option in "
"``mpy_ld.py`` to set this value when creating MPY files."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 ``mpy-tool.py`` 與 ``mpy-cross`` 中的 ``-march-flags`` 命令列選項，以及 "
"``mpy_ld.py`` 中用於在建立 MPY 檔案時設定此值的 ``--arch-flags`` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:275
msgid "The global qstr and constant tables"
msgstr "全域 qstr 與常數表"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:277
msgid ""
"An .mpy file contains a single qstr table, and a single constant object "
"table. These are global to the .mpy file, they are referenced by all nested "
"raw-code objects.  The qstr table maps internal qstr number (internal to the"
" .mpy file) to the resolved qstr number of the runtime that the .mpy file is"
" imported into. This links the .mpy file with the rest of the system that it"
" executes within. The constant object table is populated with references to "
"all constant objects that the .mpy file needs."
msgstr ""
".mpy 檔案包含單一個 qstr 表與單一個常數物件表。這些表對 .mpy 檔案而言是全域的，會被所有巢狀的 raw-code 物件參照。qstr "
"表將內部 qstr 編號（.mpy 檔案內部使用）對應到 .mpy 檔案被匯入之執行階段中已解析的 qstr 編號。這會將 .mpy "
"檔案與其執行所在的其餘系統連結起來。常數物件表中則填入 .mpy 檔案所需之所有常數物件的參照。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:288 ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:289
#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:303 ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:305
msgid "vuint"
msgstr "vuint"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:288
msgid "number of qstrs"
msgstr "qstr 的數量"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:289
msgid "number of constant objects"
msgstr "常數物件的數量"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:290 ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:291
#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:304 ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:306
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:290
msgid "qstr data"
msgstr "qstr 資料"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:291
msgid "encoded constant objects"
msgstr "已編碼的常數物件"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:295
msgid "Raw code elements"
msgstr "原始程式碼元素（raw code elements）"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:297
msgid ""
"A raw-code element contains code, either bytecode or native machine code.  "
"Its contents are:"
msgstr "raw-code 元素包含程式碼，可能是位元組碼或原生機器碼。其內容為："

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:303
msgid "type, size and whether there are sub-raw-code elements"
msgstr "類型、大小以及是否有子 raw-code 元素"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:304
msgid "code (bytecode or machine code)"
msgstr "程式碼（位元組碼或機器碼）"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:305
msgid "number of sub-raw-code elements (only if non-zero)"
msgstr "子 raw-code 元素的數量（僅在非零時出現）"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:306
msgid "sub-raw-code elements"
msgstr "子 raw-code 元素"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:309
msgid ""
"The first vuint in a raw-code element encodes the type of code stored in "
"this element (the two least-significant bits), whether this raw-code has any"
" children (the third least-significant bit), and the length of the code that"
" follows (the amount of RAM to allocate for it)."
msgstr ""
"raw-code 元素中的第一個 vuint 編碼了此元素所儲存程式碼的類型（最低有效的兩個位元）、此 raw-code "
"是否有任何子項（第三低有效的位元），以及後續程式碼的長度（為其配置的 RAM 量）。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:314
msgid ""
"Following the vuint comes the code itself.  Unless the code type is viper "
"code with relocations, this code is constant data and does not need to be "
"modified."
msgstr "vuint 之後接的是程式碼本身。除非程式碼類型是帶有重定位的 viper 程式碼，否則此程式碼為常數資料，無需修改。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:317
msgid ""
"If this raw-code has any children (as indicated by a bit in the first "
"vuint), following the code comes a vuint counting the number of sub-raw-code"
" elements."
msgstr ""
"若此 raw-code 有任何子項（如第一個 vuint 中某位元所指示），則程式碼之後接一個用以計算子 raw-code 元素數量的 vuint。"

#: ../../reference/mpyfiles.rst:320
msgid "Finally any sub-raw-code elements are stored, recursively."
msgstr "最後，會以遞迴方式儲存所有子 raw-code 元素。"
